Linus,

please pull one more ALSA updates for 2.6.28 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

This contains a few trivial fixes, SPDIF-passthru support on PS3, and
a fix specific to ASoC OMAP.

Thanks!


Takashi

